---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const structuredData = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Product",
  "name": "Caterham Nitron NTR R3 40mm Suspension Kit",
  "description": "Nitron NTR R3 40mm coilover suspension kit for the Caterham Seven — S3, SV and CSR chassis. Independently adjustable compression and rebound damping, specified for your car, tyres and application. Supplied with Nitron springs and mounting spacers.",
  "brand": {
    "@type": "Brand",
    "name": "Nitron Racing Systems"
  },
  "category": "Coilover Suspension Kit",
  "image": "https://toofasttorace.com/images/Nitron.png",
  "url": "https://toofasttorace.com/caterham/nitron-ntr-r3",
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "url": "https://toofasttorace.com/caterham/nitron-ntr-r3",
    "priceCurrency": "GBP",
    "price": "3206.46",
    "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
    "seller": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Too Fast To Race"
    }
  }
};
---

<Layout title="Caterham Nitron NTR R3 40mm Suspension Kit | S3 SV CSR | Too Fast To Race" description="Nitron NTR R3 40mm coilover suspension kit for the Caterham Seven — S3, SV and CSR. Independently adjustable compression and rebound, specified for your car. From £3,206 +VAT. Nitron springs and mounting spacers included. Bespoke specification from Too Fast To Race.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)} />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="stripe-accent"></span>
      <h1>Caterham Nitron <span class="text-green">NTR R3 40mm</span></h1>
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <div class="brand-logo-chip">
          <img src="/images/Nitron.png" alt="Nitron NTR R3 suspension for Caterham — Nitron Racing Systems" class="brand-logo" width="160" height="64" />
        </div>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">The NTR R3 adds independent control of compression and rebound — a genuine development tool for the driver who will use it with intent. For most Caterhams the R1 is enough; the R3 is for the programme that has outgrown it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Summary / Price -->
  <section class="kit-summary-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="kit-summary">
        <div class="kit-price">
          <span class="price-label">From</span>
          <span class="price-figure">£3,206</span>
          <span class="price-note">+ VAT &amp; shipping</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kit-specs">
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Damper</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Nitron NTR R3 40mm</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Adjustment</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Comp &amp; Rebound</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Springs</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Nitron (Eibach/Hyperco optional)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Chassis</span>
            <span class="spec-value">S3 · SV · CSR</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Enquire About This Kit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What It Is -->
  <section class="kit-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="showcase-grid">
        <div class="showcase-image">
          <img src="/images/NitronR3.png" alt="Nitron NTR R3 40mm coilover damper with separate compression and rebound adjustment for Caterham Seven — S3, SV and CSR" width="800" height="900" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="content-block showcase-text">
          <h2>Two Adjusters, Used With <span class="text-green">Intent</span></h2>
          <p>The Nitron NTR R3 separates compression and rebound into two independent adjusters, so each direction of damper movement can be calibrated on its own. Compression and rebound are genuinely different events with different requirements — and the R3 lets you address one without disturbing the other.</p>
          <p>That capability is only an advantage in the right hands. Used to refine a setup against chassis behaviour you can identify and measure, it is a precision instrument. Used without a process, the extra adjustment simply gives you more ways to move away from a setting that was already correct. The hardware does not make the difference on its own — the method does.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>Who the R3 is <span class="text-green">For</span></h2>
        <p>This is the kit for the dedicated Caterham programme — <a href="/track-day-suspension">circuit</a> and <a href="/hillclimb-suspension">hillclimb</a> cars under active development, drivers logging data and adjusting between events with a clear objective, and builds being refined progressively across seasons. If you understand damping theory and you adjust with purpose, the R3 rewards it.</p>
        <p>If your Caterham is a <a href="/fast-road-suspension">fast road</a> car or an occasional track day car, the single-adjustable <a href="/caterham/nitron-ntr-r1">NTR R1</a> is almost certainly the better choice — and a better use of budget. We set out exactly where that line sits in <a href="/nitron-r1-vs-r3">Nitron R1 vs R3</a>, and we will tell you honestly which side of it your car falls on.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Included / Options -->
      <div class="included-grid">
        <div class="included-col">
          <h3>What's Included</h3>
          <ul class="kit-list">
            <li>Four-corner Nitron NTR R3 40mm coilover kit</li>
            <li>Nitron springs</li>
            <li>Mounting spacers</li>
            <li>Specified for your chassis, tyres and application</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="included-col">
          <h3>Options</h3>
          <ul class="kit-list">
            <li>Eibach or Hyperco springs in place of the standard Nitron springs</li>
            <li>Hydraulic spring perches for quick ride-height adjustment</li>
            <li>Torrington bearings to reduce friction during ride-height adjustment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>Caterham <span class="text-green">Fitment</span></h2>
        <p>This kit is specified for the Caterham Seven across the S3, SV and CSR chassis. The price is the same for each — the specification work behind it is what adapts the kit to your particular car. If you are unsure which chassis you have, or how to make the most of the R3's adjustment on your car, tell us and we will guide you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related -->
  <section class="related-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="stripe-accent"></span>
        <h2>Related Expertise</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="related-grid">
        <a href="/caterham/nitron-ntr-r1" class="related-card">
          <h3>Nitron NTR R1 40mm</h3>
          <p>Single-adjustable — the right answer for the overwhelming majority of road and track day Caterhams.</p>
          <span class="related-link">View the R1 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/nitron-r1-vs-r3" class="related-card">
          <h3>R1 vs R3 Explained</h3>
          <p>The specific case where the R3's extra adjustment earns its place — and where it doesn't.</p>
          <span class="related-link">R1 vs R3 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/nitron-suspension" class="related-card">
          <h3>Nitron Suspension</h3>
          <p>The full Nitron range and how we approach specification for each application.</p>
          <span class="related-link">Nitron Systems →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/caterham/suspension" class="related-card">
          <h3>Caterham Suspension Kits</h3>
          <p>The full range of Caterham coilover kits — Nitron and Penske — in one place.</p>
          <span class="related-link">All Kits →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/hillclimb-suspension" class="related-card">
          <h3>Hillclimb Suspension</h3>
          <p>What sprint and hillclimb use demands, and why adjustability is only useful with a process.</p>
          <span class="related-link">Hillclimb →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/caterham" class="related-card">
          <h3>Caterham Specialist</h3>
          <p>Builds, conversions, setup and development from over 30 years with the Seven.</p>
          <span class="related-link">Caterham →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Specify Your R3 Kit</h2>
        <p>Tell us about your Caterham, your programme and how you develop the car. We will specify an NTR R3 kit that gives you genuine, usable adjustment — and tell you honestly if the R1 would serve you better.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Specification</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: calc(80px + var(--space-xl)) 0 var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.2);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .hero-intro .hero-subtitle {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .brand-logo-chip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--tftr-white);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    max-height: 96px;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero-intro {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      height: 44px;
    }
  }

  /* Summary / Price */
  .kit-summary-section {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
    padding: var(--space-lg) 0;
  }

  .kit-summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    border: 1px solid rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.2);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--tftr-green);
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }

  .kit-price {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .price-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
  }

  .price-figure {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .price-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
  }

  .kit-specs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .spec {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .spec-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
  }

  .spec-value {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  /* Content */
  .kit-content {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
  }

  .content-block {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .content-block h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .content-block p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .included-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .included-col {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--tftr-green);
  }

  .included-col h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .kit-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .kit-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .kit-list li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
  }

  /* Related */
  .related-section {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .related-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .related-card {
    background: var(--tftr-dark);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .related-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .related-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  .related-card p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .related-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--tftr-green-dark), var(--tftr-green));
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-content h2 {
    color: var(--tftr-black);
  }

  .cta-content p {
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: var(--space-sm) auto var(--space-md);
    max-width: 55ch;
  }

  .cta-content .btn-primary {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  .cta-content .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .kit-summary {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }

    .kit-specs {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .related-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Product Showcase */
  .showcase-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .showcase-image {
    background: var(--tftr-white);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .showcase-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 460px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .showcase-text {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .showcase-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>